import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data generic_formal_argument_deferred_whole_at_a_direct_call: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "generic_formal_argument_deferred_whole_at_a_direct_call" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: at a direct call, a generic formal's type argument is deferred as a whole (the (d) collector: skip ∧ !equals) instead of being bound or refused. The actual is not compared to a stored instance of the callee type parameter.",

    "DISTINGUISHING FACTS: this is not an unmarked leaf (that is a resolve stamp). It is not a rigid same-scope T vs T (binder equality). It is the call site where the callee's own T is FLEXIBLE and must be instantiated. v1 unify_generics first-wins; v2 infer_match_generic_formal binds the first produced and ignores a later produced.",

    "HARM: the same silent wrongness as one_type_variable_bound_to_two_distinct_coproducts, observed at the generic-arg walk rather than only at same_arm coproducts.",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: below the ladder — Accepted silent wrongness (DESIGN section 4b), the same class as one_type_variable_bound_to_two_distinct_coproducts. First-wins / skip-and-not-equals is the silence, not a mitigatable rung. V1 CEILING: structurally guaranteed only after v1 type representation is canonical (one encoding per decl, DeclarationRef stamped). A (d) hole that is two encodings of one decl is not a real refusal.",

    "NEXT TRIGGER, NAMED AS A CAPABILITY: v1 type representation canonical (one encoding per decl, DeclarationRef stamped). The v2 wall is PR B (infer_match_generic_formal rebind).",

    "CENSUS GROUPS A–H: same partition as one_type_variable_bound_to_two_distinct_coproducts receipts (Symbol/String, FreeMonoid encodings, Bool, same-name wrappers, UnresolvedDecl, flexible callee T treated as rigid, marked vs unmarked T, residual).",
  ],

  evidence: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v2.compiler.infer", decl_name: "infer_match_generic_formal", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "v1.compiler.infer", decl_name: "unify_generics", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "test.claim.constructor_tag_route_probe_red", decl_name: "same_arm_one_t_two_coproducts_must_refuse", field: WholeDeclaration },
  ],
}
